{"content": "/**
 * @layout page-layout
 * @summary Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content.
 * @remarks
 * ✅ Use Page-Layout when:
 * - You need a classic page structure with navigation and content areas
 * - The page has a clear main content area flanked by complementary regions
 * - You want consistent spacing and alignment across the layout
 * 🚫 Don't use Page-Layout when:
 * - Building a single-column page — use a simpler layout instead
 * - The sidebar competes with main content for importance
 * @accessibility
 * - Map the main content area to a `<main>` landmark
 * - Give the sidebar `role="navigation"` or `role="complementary"` as appropriate
 * - Ensure landmark regions have distinct aria-labels
 * @selector div[class~="pfx-page-layout"]
 * @part .container - Root page layout container.
 * @part .header - Top header region.
 * @part .body - Main body containing sidebar and content.
 * @part .sidebar - Left navigation or auxiliary column.
 * @part .main - Central content area.
 * @part .footer - Bottom footer region.
 * @related wrapper
 */

div[class~="pfx-page-layout"] {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

div[class~="pfx-page-layout"] .pfx-header {
  padding: var(--instui-space-medium);
  background-color: var(--instui-color-header-background);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--instui-color-border);
}

div[class~="pfx-page-layout"] .pfx-body {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1;
}

div[class~="pfx-page-layout"] .pfx-sidebar {
  width: 250px;
  padding: var(--instui-space-medium);
  background-color: var(--instui-color-sidebar-background);
  border-right: 1px solid var(--instui-color-border);
  overflow-y: auto;
}

div[class~="pfx-page-layout"] .pfx-main {
  flex: 1;
  padding: var(--instui-space-medium);
  overflow-y: auto;
}

div[class~="pfx-page-layout"] .pfx-footer {
  padding: var(--instui-space-medium);
  background-color: var(--instui-color-footer-background);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--instui-color-border);
  text-align: center;
  font-size: var(--instui-font-size-small);
  color: var(--instui-color-footer-text);
}
