{"content": "/**
 * @layout rubric-note
 * @summary Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators.
 * @remarks
 * ✅ Use Rubric-Note when:
 * - Displaying grading rubric or assessment criteria
 * - You need to structure content by category with scores or indicators
 * - The layout should emphasize structure and hierarchy
 * 🚫 Don't use Rubric-Note when:
 * - Displaying simple notes or comments — use Callout instead
 * - Complex grading logic is needed — consider a custom component
 * @accessibility
 * - Use table semantics if displaying a true rubric with rows and columns
 * - Ensure score indicators are not color-only
 * - Provide descriptive labels for each category
 * @selector div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"]
 * @part .container - Root container for the rubric note.
 * @part .header - Header with title and metadata.
 * @part .criteria - Container for rubric criteria rows.
 * @part .row - Individual criterion row.
 * @part .name - Criterion name or category.
 * @part .score - Score indicator or badge.
 * @part .description - Detailed description of the criterion.
 * @related card
 */

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] {
  padding: var(--instui-space-medium);
  border: 1px solid var(--instui-color-border);
  border-radius: var(--instui-radius-medium);
  background-color: var(--instui-color-background);
}

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] .pfx-header {
  margin-bottom: var(--instui-space-medium);
  padding-bottom: var(--instui-space-medium);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--instui-color-border);
}

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] .pfx-criteria {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--instui-space-small);
}

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] .pfx-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 2fr;
  gap: var(--instui-space-medium);
  padding: var(--instui-space-small);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--instui-color-primary);
  background-color: var(--instui-color-surface);
}

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] .pfx-name {
  font-weight: var(--instui-font-weight-semibold);
}

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] .pfx-score {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background-color: var(--instui-color-info-background);
  color: var(--instui-color-info-text);
  font-weight: var(--instui-font-weight-semibold);
  text-align: center;
}

div[class~="pfx-rubric-note"] .pfx-description {
  font-size: var(--instui-font-size-small);
  color: var(--instui-color-text-secondary);
}
